1
00:00:02,509 --> 00:00:03,843
KATARA: Water...

2
00:00:04,886 --> 00:00:06,304
Earth...

3
00:00:06,804 --> 00:00:08,139
Fire...

4
00:00:09,057 --> 00:00:10,308
Air.

5
00:00:11,142 --> 00:00:14,646
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

6
00:00:15,313 --> 00:00:18,816
Then, everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:19,692 --> 00:00:22,570
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

8
00:00:22,654 --> 00:00:23,780
could stop them.

9
00:00:23,863 --> 00:00:25,532
But when the world needed him most,

10
00:00:25,615 --> 00:00:26,866
he vanished.

11
00:00:27,325 --> 00:00:28,409
100 years passed,

12
00:00:28,493 --> 00:00:31,204
and my brother and I
discovered the new Avatar―

13
00:00:31,287 --> 00:00:32,830
An airbender named Aang.

14
00:00:32,914 --> 00:00:35,124
And although his airbending
skills are great,

15
00:00:35,208 --> 00:00:37,835
he has a lot to learn
before he's ready to save anyone.

16
00:00:37,919 --> 00:00:39,087
AANG: Oof.

17
00:00:39,170 --> 00:00:41,839
KATARA: But I believe
Aang can save the world.

18
00:01:23,134 --> 00:01:24,219
Aah!

19
00:01:33,228 --> 00:01:34,729
( AANG BREATHING HEAVILY )

20
00:01:39,401 --> 00:01:40,402
Aang?

21
00:01:42,279 --> 00:01:43,697
Do you want to talk about it?

22
00:01:43,780 --> 00:01:46,616
Nah. Just a nightmare.

23
00:01:46,700 --> 00:01:48,827
I was in the Avatar state,

24
00:01:48,910 --> 00:01:51,079
But I was outside my body,
watching myself.

25
00:01:51,955 --> 00:01:53,456
It was scary.

26
00:01:53,540 --> 00:01:55,000
I was scary.

27
00:02:00,588 --> 00:02:03,341
Katara, I want you to have this.

28
00:02:03,425 --> 00:02:06,344
This amulet contains
water from the spirit oasis.

29
00:02:07,053 --> 00:02:09,097
The water has unique properties.

30
00:02:09,180 --> 00:02:10,515
Don't lose it.

31
00:02:11,182 --> 00:02:12,809
Thank you, Master Pakku.

32
00:02:12,892 --> 00:02:16,354
Aang, these scrolls
will help you master waterbending.

33
00:02:16,438 --> 00:02:20,442
But remember,
they're no substitute for a real master.

34
00:02:25,447 --> 00:02:26,448
Sokka...

35
00:02:27,907 --> 00:02:29,617
Take care, son.

36
00:02:31,578 --> 00:02:34,789
Fly straight to the Earth Kingdom
base to the east of here.

37
00:02:34,873 --> 00:02:38,043
General Fong will provide you
with an escort to Omashu.

38
00:02:38,501 --> 00:02:43,506
There you'll be safe to begin
your earthbending training with King Bumi.

39
00:02:43,590 --> 00:02:46,134
- Appa, yip-yip!
- KATARA: Say hi to Gran-Gran for me.

40
00:02:54,601 --> 00:02:55,769
Ahh.

41
00:02:57,228 --> 00:02:59,814
This is what I've been missing.

42
00:02:59,898 --> 00:03:03,777
Who knew floating
on a piece of driftwood for three weeks

43
00:03:03,860 --> 00:03:05,528
with no food or water

44
00:03:06,279 --> 00:03:09,282
and sea vultures
waiting to pluck out your liver

45
00:03:09,366 --> 00:03:11,701
could make one so tense?

46
00:03:13,787 --> 00:03:18,124
I see. It's the anniversary, isn't it?

47
00:03:18,208 --> 00:03:20,794
Three years ago today, I was banished.

48
00:03:20,877 --> 00:03:23,713
I lost it all. I want it back.

49
00:03:24,255 --> 00:03:28,134
I want the Avatar.
I want my honor, my throne.

50
00:03:28,218 --> 00:03:31,096
I want my father
not to think I'm worthless.

51
00:03:31,346 --> 00:03:36,434
I'm sure he doesn't.
Why would he banish you if he didn't care?

52
00:03:38,853 --> 00:03:41,314
Uh, that came out wrong, didn't it?

53
00:04:05,338 --> 00:04:08,758
My brother and my uncle
have disgraced the Fire Lord,

54
00:04:08,842 --> 00:04:10,468
and brought shame on all of us.

55
00:04:11,010 --> 00:04:14,431
You may have mixed feelings about
attacking members of the royal family.

56
00:04:14,514 --> 00:04:16,891
I understand. But I assure you,

57
00:04:16,975 --> 00:04:21,104
if you hesitate, I will not hesitate
to bring you down.

58
00:04:21,604 --> 00:04:23,106
Dismissed.

59
00:04:23,982 --> 00:04:28,236
Princess, I'm afraid the tides will not
allow us to bring the ship into port

60
00:04:28,319 --> 00:04:29,446
before nightfall.

61
00:04:29,529 --> 00:04:32,740
I'm sorry, captain, but I do not know
much about the tides.

62
00:04:33,199 --> 00:04:34,826
Can you explain something to me?

63
00:04:35,410 --> 00:04:36,870
Of course, your highness.

64
00:04:36,953 --> 00:04:38,872
Do the tides command this ship?

65
00:04:39,122 --> 00:04:41,833
Uh, I'm afraid I don't understand.

66
00:04:41,916 --> 00:04:45,587
You said the tides
would not allow us to bring the ship in.

67
00:04:45,670 --> 00:04:47,839
Do the tides command this ship?

68
00:04:48,214 --> 00:04:49,215
No, princess.

69
00:04:49,591 --> 00:04:51,801
And if I were to have you
thrown overboard,

70
00:04:51,885 --> 00:04:56,431
would the tides think twice about
smashing you against the rocky shore?

71
00:04:56,514 --> 00:04:57,974
No, princess.

72
00:04:58,057 --> 00:05:00,977
Well, then maybe you should
worry less about the tides,

73
00:05:01,060 --> 00:05:03,480
who've already made up
their mind about killing you

74
00:05:03,563 --> 00:05:06,357
and worry more about me,
who's still mulling it over.

75
00:05:06,900 --> 00:05:08,109
I'll pull us in.

76
00:05:13,406 --> 00:05:14,449
There it is!

77
00:05:21,706 --> 00:05:24,250
Welcome, Avatar Aang!

78
00:05:24,792 --> 00:05:27,003
I am General Fong.

79
00:05:27,086 --> 00:05:30,173
And welcome to all of you great heroes―

80
00:05:30,256 --> 00:05:35,053
Appa, Momo, brave Sokka,
the mighty Katara.

81
00:05:35,553 --> 00:05:37,472
Mighty Katara? I like that.

82
00:05:37,555 --> 00:05:38,723
( FIREWORKS )

83
00:05:38,806 --> 00:05:39,849
( MOMO CHATTERING )

84
00:05:44,562 --> 00:05:46,231
Not bad. Not bad.

85
00:05:47,899 --> 00:05:50,568
Avatar Aang, we were all amazed

86
00:05:50,652 --> 00:05:53,154
at the stories of how
you single-handedly wiped out

87
00:05:53,238 --> 00:05:55,406
an entire fire navy fleet
at the North Pole.

88
00:05:56,032 --> 00:05:59,786
I can't imagine what it feels like
to wield such devastating power.

89
00:05:59,869 --> 00:06:01,829
It's an awesome responsibility.

90
00:06:01,913 --> 00:06:03,915
I try not to think about it too much.

91
00:06:04,916 --> 00:06:08,586
Avatar, you're ready
to face the Fire Lord now.

92
00:06:08,670 --> 00:06:10,713
What?! No, I'm not.

93
00:06:11,297 --> 00:06:13,841
Aang still needs to master
all four elements.

94
00:06:14,092 --> 00:06:16,886
Why? With the kind of power he possesses,

95
00:06:16,970 --> 00:06:20,306
Power enough to destroy hundreds
of battleships in a matter of minutes,

96
00:06:20,390 --> 00:06:22,267
He could defeat the Fire Lord now.

97
00:06:22,350 --> 00:06:24,852
But, sir, the thing is,
Aang can only do those things

98
00:06:24,936 --> 00:06:26,729
when he's in the Avatar state.

99
00:06:26,813 --> 00:06:28,690
See, it's this special state where―

100
00:06:28,773 --> 00:06:31,401
I'm well aware.
Your eyes and tattoos glow,

101
00:06:31,484 --> 00:06:34,237
and you're able to summon
unbelievable power.

102
00:06:34,946 --> 00:06:38,116
Without you, we'd be slaughtered
before we even reach their shores.

103
00:06:38,199 --> 00:06:40,868
But with you leading the way,
as the ultimate weapon,

104
00:06:41,244 --> 00:06:44,581
we could cut a swath right through
to the heart of the Fire Nation.

105
00:06:44,914 --> 00:06:49,252
Right, but I don't know how
to get in or out of the Avatar state,

106
00:06:49,794 --> 00:06:51,921
much less what to do once I'm there.

107
00:06:52,130 --> 00:06:53,464
FONG: So it's decided, then.

108
00:06:53,548 --> 00:06:56,301
I'll help you figure out
how to get into the Avatar state,

109
00:06:56,384 --> 00:06:58,011
and then you'll face your destiny.

110
00:06:58,094 --> 00:06:59,971
No. Nothing's decided.

111
00:07:00,054 --> 00:07:01,681
We already have a plan.

112
00:07:01,931 --> 00:07:04,183
Aang's pursuing his destiny his way.

113
00:07:04,517 --> 00:07:07,729
FONG: Well, while you take your time
learning the elements,

114
00:07:07,812 --> 00:07:09,480
the war goes on.

115
00:07:10,315 --> 00:07:11,608
May I show you something?

116
00:07:12,900 --> 00:07:14,569
That's the infirmary.

117
00:07:14,652 --> 00:07:18,823
And those soldiers
are the lucky ones. They came back.

118
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:21,576
Every day the Fire Nation takes lives.

119
00:07:21,659 --> 00:07:23,453
People are dying, Aang.

120
00:07:23,953 --> 00:07:25,913
You could end it now.

121
00:07:26,372 --> 00:07:27,373
Think about it.

122
00:07:46,809 --> 00:07:48,353
Almost perfect.

123
00:07:48,436 --> 00:07:50,521
One hair out of place.

124
00:07:52,231 --> 00:07:53,941
Almost isn't good enough.

125
00:07:59,113 --> 00:08:00,281
( DISTANT THUNDER )

126
00:08:06,537 --> 00:08:07,747
General Fong?

127
00:08:07,830 --> 00:08:10,500
Come in, Aang.
Have you thought about our discussion?

128
00:08:12,669 --> 00:08:13,961
I'm in.

129
00:08:14,045 --> 00:08:15,296
I'll fight the Fire Lord.

130
00:08:27,892 --> 00:08:29,977
I told the general I'd help him

131
00:08:30,478 --> 00:08:32,397
by going into the Avatar state.

132
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:34,941
Aang, no. This is not the right way.

133
00:08:35,024 --> 00:08:38,236
Why not? Remember when he took out
the fire navy? He was incredible.

134
00:08:38,736 --> 00:08:40,279
There's a right way to do this―

135
00:08:40,363 --> 00:08:42,198
Practice, study, and discipline.

136
00:08:42,281 --> 00:08:45,076
Or just glow it up
and stop that Fire Lord.

137
00:08:45,159 --> 00:08:48,788
If you two meatheads want to throw away
everything we've worked for, fine.

138
00:08:48,871 --> 00:08:50,289
Go ahead and glow it up.

139
00:08:50,498 --> 00:08:53,292
Katara, I'm just being realistic!

140
00:08:53,376 --> 00:08:55,795
I don't have time
to do this the right way.

141
00:09:01,175 --> 00:09:04,595
This rare chi-enhancing tea
is a natural stimulant.

142
00:09:05,221 --> 00:09:09,517
In an ordinary warrior,
it improves strength and energy tenfold.

143
00:09:09,934 --> 00:09:13,438
In you, it may induce the Avatar state.

144
00:09:13,730 --> 00:09:15,314
Tenfold energy, huh?

145
00:09:18,609 --> 00:09:20,027
Is it working? Is it working?

146
00:09:20,111 --> 00:09:22,780
I can't tell! Somebody tell me
if I'm in the Avatar state

147
00:09:22,864 --> 00:09:25,742
'Cause I don't have a good view
of myself. Am I talking loud?

148
00:09:25,825 --> 00:09:27,952
I guess he could talk
the Fire Lord to death.

149
00:09:28,536 --> 00:09:29,704
Uh!

150
00:09:31,831 --> 00:09:34,083
Maybe I can shock you
into the Avatar state.

151
00:09:34,542 --> 00:09:35,585
I love surprises.

152
00:09:37,712 --> 00:09:39,589
-( SCREECHES )
- Aah!

153
00:09:41,632 --> 00:09:42,842
Still not glowing.

154
00:09:43,050 --> 00:09:45,636
Uh! Uh! Aah!

155
00:09:49,849 --> 00:09:52,977
You are wearing a ceremonial
piece of clothing

156
00:09:53,060 --> 00:09:55,897
from each of the bending nations.

157
00:09:55,980 --> 00:09:59,609
Now, I will join
the four elements into one.

158
00:09:59,692 --> 00:10:05,531
Water, earth, fire, air!

159
00:10:05,615 --> 00:10:08,618
Four elements together as one.

160
00:10:10,244 --> 00:10:11,579
This is just mud.

161
00:10:11,662 --> 00:10:13,873
So, do you feel anything?

162
00:10:17,543 --> 00:10:19,128
( SNEEZES )

163
00:10:20,171 --> 00:10:21,756
We have to find a way.

164
00:10:25,218 --> 00:10:28,554
Look at these magnificent shells.

165
00:10:28,638 --> 00:10:32,225
I'll enjoy these keepsakes
for years to come.

166
00:10:32,308 --> 00:10:34,185
We don't need any more useless things.

167
00:10:34,560 --> 00:10:37,104
You forget,
we have to carry everything ourselves now.

168
00:10:37,188 --> 00:10:40,441
Hello, brother, uncle.

169
00:10:40,525 --> 00:10:42,276
What are you doing here?

170
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:46,531
In my country, we exchange
a pleasant hello before asking questions.

171
00:10:46,906 --> 00:10:49,826
Have you become uncivilized
so soon, Zu Zu?

172
00:10:49,909 --> 00:10:51,244
Don't call me that.

173
00:10:51,702 --> 00:10:54,288
To what do we owe this honor?

174
00:10:54,372 --> 00:10:56,582
Hmm, must be a family trait.

175
00:10:56,666 --> 00:10:58,626
Both of you so quick to get to the point.

176
00:10:59,752 --> 00:11:01,712
I've come with a message from home.

177
00:11:01,796 --> 00:11:06,217
Father's changed his mind. Family is
suddenly very important to him.

178
00:11:06,300 --> 00:11:08,928
He's heard rumors
of plans to overthrow him―

179
00:11:09,011 --> 00:11:10,763
Treacherous plots.

180
00:11:11,180 --> 00:11:14,600
Family are the only ones
you can really trust.

181
00:11:15,852 --> 00:11:19,355
Father regrets your banishment.
He wants you home.

182
00:11:21,732 --> 00:11:26,237
Did you hear me? You should be happy,
excited, grateful.

183
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:28,447
I just gave you great news.

184
00:11:28,531 --> 00:11:31,117
I'm sure your brother
simply needs a moment―

185
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:32,326
Don't interrupt, uncle.

186
00:11:33,077 --> 00:11:34,829
I still haven't heard my thank you.

187
00:11:34,912 --> 00:11:37,748
I'm not a messenger.
I didn't have to come all this way.

188
00:11:38,249 --> 00:11:42,545
Father regrets? He wants me back?

189
00:11:42,753 --> 00:11:45,214
I can see you need time to take this in.

190
00:11:45,298 --> 00:11:48,175
I'll come to call on you tomorrow.
Good evening.

191
00:11:51,846 --> 00:11:54,223
KATARA: Can we talk about something?
AANG: Sure.

192
00:11:54,765 --> 00:11:56,934
Do you remember
when we were at the air temple

193
00:11:57,018 --> 00:11:58,895
and you found Monk Gyatso's skeleton?

194
00:11:59,312 --> 00:12:02,023
It must have been so horrible
and traumatic for you.

195
00:12:02,982 --> 00:12:05,943
I saw you get so upset
that you weren't even you anymore.

196
00:12:06,027 --> 00:12:11,115
I'm not saying the Avatar state
doesn't have incredible and helpful power.

197
00:12:11,198 --> 00:12:14,869
But you have to understand,
for the people who love you,

198
00:12:14,952 --> 00:12:18,122
watching you be in that much
rage and pain is really scary.

199
00:12:19,916 --> 00:12:21,918
I'm really glad you told me that,

200
00:12:22,710 --> 00:12:24,462
But I still need to do this.

201
00:12:24,545 --> 00:12:26,005
I don't understand.

202
00:12:26,088 --> 00:12:27,465
No, you don't.

203
00:12:27,882 --> 00:12:29,967
Every day, more and more people die.

204
00:12:30,051 --> 00:12:32,094
I'm already a hundred years late.

205
00:12:32,178 --> 00:12:35,056
Defeating the Fire Lord
is the only way to stop this war.

206
00:12:35,139 --> 00:12:36,891
I have to try it.

207
00:12:37,141 --> 00:12:39,435
I can't watch you do this to yourself.

208
00:12:39,518 --> 00:12:41,312
I'm not coming tomorrow.

209
00:12:42,229 --> 00:12:43,230
Good night.

210
00:12:43,314 --> 00:12:44,315
Good night.

211
00:12:46,651 --> 00:12:47,652
We're going home

212
00:12:48,110 --> 00:12:49,528
after three long years.

213
00:12:49,612 --> 00:12:50,905
It's unbelievable.

214
00:12:51,364 --> 00:12:53,658
It is unbelievable.

215
00:12:53,741 --> 00:12:56,744
I have never known my brother
to regret anything.

216
00:12:57,411 --> 00:12:59,038
Did you listen to Azula?

217
00:12:59,121 --> 00:13:01,499
Father's realized how important
family is to him.

218
00:13:01,582 --> 00:13:02,750
He cares about me.

219
00:13:03,250 --> 00:13:04,710
I care about you.

220
00:13:04,794 --> 00:13:07,838
I mean, if Ozai wants you back, well,

221
00:13:07,922 --> 00:13:11,008
I think it may not be
for the reasons you imagine.

222
00:13:11,092 --> 00:13:13,177
You don't know
how my father feels about me.

223
00:13:13,260 --> 00:13:14,512
You don't know anything.

224
00:13:14,595 --> 00:13:17,974
Zuko, I only meant that in our family,

225
00:13:18,349 --> 00:13:20,601
things are not always what they seem.

226
00:13:21,102 --> 00:13:23,396
I think you are exactly what you seem―

227
00:13:23,479 --> 00:13:26,482
A lazy, mistrustful, shallow old man

228
00:13:26,565 --> 00:13:28,901
who's always been jealous of his brother.

229
00:13:42,081 --> 00:13:43,290
Aah!

230
00:13:49,922 --> 00:13:52,049
Sokka, Sokka, wake up.

231
00:13:52,133 --> 00:13:53,342
Huh?

232
00:13:53,426 --> 00:13:56,387
I don't think we should be trying
to bring on the Avatar state.

233
00:13:56,846 --> 00:13:58,681
- You sure?
- Yes.

234
00:13:58,889 --> 00:14:00,016
Ok.

235
00:14:00,099 --> 00:14:01,976
Do you think the general will be mad?

236
00:14:02,309 --> 00:14:04,520
What can he say? You're the Avatar.

237
00:14:04,603 --> 00:14:05,855
Who knows better than you?

238
00:14:13,654 --> 00:14:14,739
Wait!

239
00:14:14,822 --> 00:14:16,824
Don't leave without me.

240
00:14:17,450 --> 00:14:20,119
Uncle, you've changed your mind.

241
00:14:20,202 --> 00:14:22,371
Family sticks together, right?

242
00:14:27,376 --> 00:14:28,836
We're finally going home.

243
00:14:34,925 --> 00:14:39,346
AANG: The thing is, I don't think we'll
ever be able to trigger it on purpose.

244
00:14:39,847 --> 00:14:41,182
So I guess that's it.

245
00:14:41,682 --> 00:14:43,434
Sure I can't change your mind?

246
00:14:43,768 --> 00:14:47,855
I'm sure. I can only reach the Avatar
state when I'm in genuine danger.

247
00:14:48,355 --> 00:14:51,817
I see. I was afraid you'd say that.

248
00:14:55,571 --> 00:14:56,614
Aang!

249
00:14:57,364 --> 00:14:58,866
( AANG YELLS )

250
00:15:03,954 --> 00:15:07,583
Men, attack the Avatar.

251
00:15:22,765 --> 00:15:24,141
What are you doing?

252
00:15:24,391 --> 00:15:26,268
I believe we are about to get results.

253
00:15:34,193 --> 00:15:37,696
I'm not your enemy. I won't fight you.

254
00:16:13,941 --> 00:16:15,693
You can't run forever!

255
00:16:16,110 --> 00:16:17,528
You can't fight forever.

256
00:16:35,629 --> 00:16:37,464
Brother, uncle,

257
00:16:37,882 --> 00:16:39,175
welcome.

258
00:16:40,384 --> 00:16:42,845
I'm so glad you decided to come.

259
00:16:43,637 --> 00:16:46,140
Are we ready to depart, your highness?

260
00:16:46,348 --> 00:16:48,684
Set our course for home, captain.

261
00:16:49,101 --> 00:16:50,352
Home.

262
00:16:50,769 --> 00:16:53,230
You heard the princess. Raise the anchors.

263
00:16:53,314 --> 00:16:55,107
We're taking the prisoners home.

264
00:16:57,735 --> 00:16:59,278
Your highness, I...

265
00:17:07,703 --> 00:17:08,787
You lied to me.

266
00:17:09,163 --> 00:17:10,831
Like I've never done that before.

267
00:17:13,459 --> 00:17:14,460
( YELLS )

268
00:17:14,543 --> 00:17:15,544
Aah!

269
00:17:18,339 --> 00:17:20,549
I wonder what crazy thing
they're trying now.

270
00:17:21,300 --> 00:17:22,927
( PURRS )

271
00:17:23,010 --> 00:17:24,345
( HEAVY THUDS )

272
00:17:24,428 --> 00:17:26,388
Maybe we should just make sure Aang's ok.

273
00:17:29,683 --> 00:17:30,935
What's going on?

274
00:17:31,018 --> 00:17:32,436
The general's gone crazy.

275
00:17:32,811 --> 00:17:35,522
He's trying to force Aang
into the Avatar state.

276
00:17:43,530 --> 00:17:45,866
Good bird-horse thingy.

277
00:17:53,332 --> 00:17:56,543
Maybe you can avoid me, but she can't.

278
00:18:08,597 --> 00:18:09,723
I can't move.

279
00:18:10,307 --> 00:18:11,558
Don't hurt her.

280
00:18:17,815 --> 00:18:19,149
Katara, no!

281
00:18:21,026 --> 00:18:23,195
Whoa!

282
00:18:24,780 --> 00:18:27,199
Stop this! You have to let her go.

283
00:18:27,283 --> 00:18:29,743
You could save her
if you were in the Avatar state.

284
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:32,454
I'm trying. I'm trying.

285
00:18:32,913 --> 00:18:34,415
Aang, I'm sinking!

286
00:18:34,873 --> 00:18:36,542
I don't see glowing.

287
00:18:38,377 --> 00:18:40,170
Aah! Please.

288
00:18:40,629 --> 00:18:42,423
You don't need to do this.

289
00:18:42,506 --> 00:18:44,842
Apparently, I do.

290
00:18:46,302 --> 00:18:47,303
Aah!

291
00:18:51,974 --> 00:18:53,100
It worked.

292
00:18:53,183 --> 00:18:54,852
It worked!

293
00:19:00,566 --> 00:19:01,775
Aah!

294
00:19:15,456 --> 00:19:17,166
Zuko, let's go!

295
00:19:19,793 --> 00:19:21,337
Hyah! Hyah! Hyah...

296
00:19:25,466 --> 00:19:28,635
You know, father blames uncle
for the loss at the North Pole.

297
00:19:28,719 --> 00:19:32,514
And he considers you a miserable failure
for not finding the Avatar.

298
00:19:33,015 --> 00:19:34,558
Why would he want you back home,

299
00:19:34,641 --> 00:19:37,561
except to lock you up
where you can no longer embarrass him?

300
00:19:38,812 --> 00:19:40,105
( YELLING )

301
00:20:09,802 --> 00:20:11,220
Aah! Uh!

302
00:20:17,226 --> 00:20:20,771
Avatar Aang, can you hear me?

303
00:20:21,522 --> 00:20:23,399
Your friend is safe.

304
00:20:23,482 --> 00:20:26,026
It was just a trick
to trigger the Avatar state.

305
00:20:26,735 --> 00:20:28,278
And it worked!

306
00:20:50,676 --> 00:20:52,719
It's time you learned.

307
00:20:58,016 --> 00:21:01,061
The Avatar state is a defense mechanism

308
00:21:01,145 --> 00:21:06,984
designed to empower you with the skills
and knowledge of all the past Avatars.

309
00:21:07,067 --> 00:21:11,029
The glow is the combination
of all your past lives

310
00:21:11,780 --> 00:21:15,200
focusing their energy through your body.

311
00:21:18,620 --> 00:21:20,456
In the Avatar state,

312
00:21:20,789 --> 00:21:22,749
you are at your most powerful...

313
00:21:24,960 --> 00:21:28,130
But you're also at your most vulnerable.

314
00:21:28,213 --> 00:21:29,256
What do you mean?

315
00:21:29,339 --> 00:21:31,508
If you are killed in the Avatar state,

316
00:21:32,426 --> 00:21:35,721
The reincarnation cycle will be broken

317
00:21:35,804 --> 00:21:39,141
and the Avatar will cease to exist.

318
00:21:56,617 --> 00:22:01,038
I'm sorry, Katara. I hope you never
have to see me like that again.

319
00:22:01,121 --> 00:22:04,166
Ha! Are you joking?
That was almost perfect.

320
00:22:04,249 --> 00:22:07,461
We just have to find out a way
to control you when you're like that.

321
00:22:07,544 --> 00:22:08,962
You're out of your mind.

322
00:22:09,046 --> 00:22:11,840
I guess we'll figure it out
on the way to the Fire Nation.

323
00:22:13,258 --> 00:22:14,801
Anybody got a problem with that?

324
00:22:16,386 --> 00:22:19,306
Do you still want an escort to Omashu?

325
00:22:20,557 --> 00:22:21,850
I think we're all set.

326
00:22:27,022 --> 00:22:28,899
Anyone who harbors these traitors

327
00:22:28,982 --> 00:22:30,943
will face the wrath of the Fire Lord.

328
00:22:32,361 --> 00:22:34,696
There will be no place left to hide.

329
00:22:41,161 --> 00:22:42,829
I think we're safe here.
